n issues", "description": "'@[PERSON_NAME_0054] also needs to come up with a better process to inform engineers that this has been updated since it's a dynamic working environment. We can start with commenting on Figma using @ person tagging.\n\nThis is old:\n\n![image.png]([URL_50036])\n\nThis is new:\n\n![image.png]([URL_50035])\n\nAlso please make sure there are no bitmap compression issues causing blurry edges.\n\nHere is screenshot comparing old vs. new\n\n![image.png]([URL_50034])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-01-03T06:39:52Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T15:34:38Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 959280, "labels": ["Submission Blocker", "Improvement"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-01-03T06:39:52Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T15:34:38Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2673", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "record": {"id": "ENG-524", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-524", "number": 524, "title": "Please update bottom navigation bar to the latest", "description": "It should look like this per Figma:\n\n![image.png]([URL_50037])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-01-03T06:41:35Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T15:33:39Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 959281, "labels": ["Submission Blocker", "Improvement", "Main Game"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-01-03T06:41:35Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T15:33:39Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2678", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "